     the gun it was still holding, which read as "detected AND not
     detected". The gun the Core HOLDS is the one its scripts follow, so
     that is the card; whether this frame's text was legible is telemetry
     and lives in the reader's own tools, not on HOME.

       state     reticle    name                           status line
       ok        locked     PDW-57                          Profile loaded | 2 Auto Actions on
       looking   scanning   Looking for your weapon…   Reading the screen
       none      idle       No weapon out                   Auto Actions paused
       unloaded  idle       Detection not set up            No game's weapon names on your Core
